# Keep the README updated

When you change how a user runs this project, update [ReadMe.md](ReadMe.md) in the same change.

Update it when you add, rename, or remove:

- Compose profiles, services, or recommended commands (`windows`, `nemo`, `ocr`, `run`, `up`, `build`)
- CLI flags, env vars, or `.env.example` keys
- Presets, backends, or Docker build args
- Install extras, cache paths, or overwrite / resume behavior

The Windows default command is:

```powershell
docker compose --profile windows build
docker compose --profile windows up
docker compose --profile windows down
```

Do not leave old `docker compose run` examples as the only documented path if a newer command replaced them. Keep copy-pasteable PowerShell/bash blocks accurate.
